  ('<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#ffffff;"><div style="background:#4d148c;padding:14px 18px;"><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.3px;">FedEx</span></div><div style="padding:18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;">We attempted to deliver your package but no one was available.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;">Reschedule your delivery to receive it.</p><div style="margin:18px 0 8px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#4d148c;color:#ffffff;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Reschedule delivery</span></div><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;word-break:break-all;">https://fedex-deliverysupport.com/reschedule</p></div><div style="padding:12px 18px;background:#f4f4f5;color:#71717a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;">FedEx automated delivery notification.</div></div>', true, 'HARD', 'The wording is clean, so the domain is the tell: FedEx uses fedex.com, and the added ''-deliverysupport'' marks a look-alike.', '{"kind":"email","subject":"Delivery attempt failed","senderName":"FedEx","senderAddress":"tracking@fedex-deliverysupport.com","bodyFormat":"html","seedId":"eml-127"}'::jsonb),
  ('<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#ffffff;"><div style="background:#4d148c;padding:14px 18px;"><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.3px;">FedEx</span></div><div style="padding:18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;">Your package is out for delivery and should arrive today.</p><div style="margin:18px 0 8px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#4d148c;color:#ffffff;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Track package</span></div><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;word-break:break-all;">https://www.fedex.com/track</p></div><div style="padding:12px 18px;background:#f4f4f5;color:#71717a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;">FedEx automated delivery notification.</div></div>', false, 'EASY', 'Sender and link are both fedex.com; a routine delivery update.', '{"kind":"email","subject":"Your package is out for delivery","senderName":"FedEx","senderAddress":"trackingupdates@fedex.com","bodyFormat":"html","seedId":"eml-128"}'::jsonb),
