  ('<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#ffffff;"><div style="background:#4285f4;padding:14px 18px;"><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.3px;">Google</span></div><div style="padding:18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;">Your Google Account was just signed in to on a new Windows device.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;">If this was you, you don''t need to do anything. You can review activity in your account.</p></div><div style="padding:12px 18px;background:#f4f4f5;color:#71717a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;">You received this email to let you know about important changes to your Google Account.</div></div>', false, 'MEDIUM', 'accounts.google.com is genuine; the alert is informational and does not ask for your password.', '{"kind":"email","subject":"Security alert: new sign-in on Windows","senderName":"Google","senderAddress":"no-reply@accounts.google.com","bodyFormat":"html","seedId":"eml-130"}'::jsonb),
  ('<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#ffffff;"><div style="background:#1a73e8;padding:14px 18px;"><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.3px;">Google Calendar</span></div><div style="padding:18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;">You have been invited to ''Q2 Budget Review'' on Thursday 2:00pm.</p><div style="margin:18px 0 8px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#1a73e8;color:#ffffff;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Join meeting</span></div><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;word-break:break-all;">https://g00gle-invites.com/j/BR2Q</p></div><div style="padding:12px 18px;background:#f4f4f5;color:#71717a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;">You are receiving this because you have a Google Calendar.</div></div>', true, 'EXPERT', 'The invite looks completely routine, but ''g00gle'' uses zeros for the o''s; genuine invites come from google.com.', '{"kind":"email","subject":"Invitation: Q2 Budget Review","senderName":"Google Calendar","senderAddress":"calendar-invite@g00gle-invites.com","bodyFormat":"html","seedId":"eml-131"}'::jsonb),
